-- statement:
--   **Proposition 14 (unconditional).** On `[P] × [2^K]^D × [S]` with bit `ρ` of every chunk selected, the layer procedure whose `C`-layer is the recursive complex-network program (`cRecC`) returns exactly `Q_p(H0^{⊗D} z)`; for disk inputs every output coefficient lies in the unit disk and differs from the exact layer `H0^{⊗D} z` by less than `√2 · 2^{-p}`.
